docs {
  # Downloads the configured standard ActiveGate installer of the target version for the specified OS

  **Deprecated**

  The downloaded version is the configured ActiveGate target version. If no target version is configured, the latest available version is downloaded. **Deprecation notice:** This endpoint is deprecated. Use the Fleet Management API endpoint `/platform/fleet-management/v1/activegate/installer/{os-type}/{arch}`

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:deployment:download`, `fleet-management:activegates:download`

  **API token scopes:** InstallerDownload
}
